{
    "chapter_num": 6,
    "verses_count": 15,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Seven Chosen to Serve"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now in those days, when "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "the number of"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the disciples was multiplying, there arose a complaint against the Hebrews by the Hellenists,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Greek-speaking Jews"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " because their widows were neglected in the daily distribution. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the twelve summoned the multitude of the disciples and said, “It is not desirable that we should leave the word of God and serve tables. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore, brethren, seek out from among you seven men of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "good"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " reputation, full of the Holy Spirit and wisdom, whom we may appoint over this business; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "but we will give ourselves continually to prayer and to the ministry of the word.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And the saying pleased the whole multitude. And they chose Stephen, a man full of faith and the Holy Spirit, and Philip, Prochorus, Nicanor, Timon, Parmenas, and Nicolas, a proselyte from Antioch, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "whom they set before the apostles; and when they had prayed, they laid hands on them."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then the word of God spread, and the number of the disciples multiplied greatly in Jerusalem, and a great many of the priests were obedient to the faith."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Stephen Accused of Blasphemy"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And Stephen, full of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU grace"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "faith and power, did great wonders and signs among the people. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then there arose some from what is called the Synagogue of the Freedmen (Cyrenians, Alexandrians, and those from Cilicia and Asia), disputing with Stephen. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And they were not able to resist the wisdom and the Spirit by which he spoke. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Then they secretly induced men to say, “We have heard him speak blasphemous words against Moses and God.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And they stirred up the people, the elders, and the scribes; and they came upon "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "him,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " seized him, and brought "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "him"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to the council. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "They also set up false witnesses who said, “This man does not cease to speak "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits blasphemous"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "blasphemous words against this holy place and the law; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "for we have heard him say that this Jesus of Nazareth will destroy this place and change the customs which Moses delivered to us.” "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And all who sat in the council, looking steadfastly at him, saw his face as the face of an angel."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}